<title>SINGAPORE: GP Batteries 10 million shares taken up.</title>
<headline>GP Batteries 10 million shares taken up.</headline>
<dateline>SINGAPORE 1997-06-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>GP Batteries International Ltd, the Singapore-listed subsidiary of Hong Kong Gold Peak Industries (Holdings) Ltd, said on Friday its seven million placement shares were fully taken up by institutional investors. It said in a statement the remaining three million shares offered by Gold Peak to retail investors had also been fully taken up.</p>
<p>-- Singapore newsroom (65 8703080)</p>
</text>
